1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. exd5 cxd5 { Start of the Exchange Variation } { [%cal Gc2c4,Gg1f3] } 4. Nf3 { [%csl Rc8][%cal Gb8c6,Gg8f6,Rc8f5,Rf5g4,Bf1b5,Bb5e8,Bc8d7,Ye7e6,Yf8d6,Ye8g8] } (4. c4 Nf6 { [%csl Ge6][%cal Ge7e6] } 5. Nf3 e6 { [%csl Ge6][%cal Gc8b7] } 6. Nc3 Be7 7. Be2 O-O (7... dxc4 8. Bxc4 { Wins a tempo } 8... O-O { [%cal Gc8b7,Gb7b6] }) 8. O-O { [%cal Gb7b6,Gc8b7] }) 4... Nc6 5. Nc3 Nf6 6. Be2 Bf5 { g4 is not a good move right now, because there is no pin on the queen } { [%csl Gg4,Ge2][%cal Gf5g4,Gg4d1] } 7. O-O e6 8. Bf4 { [%cal Gf8e7,Ge7d6] } 8... Be7 9. Re1 O-O { [%csl Re4][%cal Ga8c8,Ga7a6,Gb7b5,Rf6e4] } *


